+# TLS backend
+
+No current decision on the TLS backend is recorded for this project. The only related record is an earlier decision to standardize cryptographic implementation on OpenSSL, which was not specific to TLS. A later record shows that decision being reconsidered, with a pure-Rust alternative under evaluation to avoid C binding complexity. That reconsideration has no recorded outcome, so no TLS backend is currently confirmed. This policy should be updated once a decision is recorded.
